{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d1cd8134510d691c","name":"Computerized Interface Scope","source":{"id":"source:reference-d1cd8134510d691c","title":"Computerized Interface Scope","revision":20605,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:10:24Z","sha256":"26981c30b93b1d0732cd3d7e7bbbc4eaeea386f2f07aa17c98bac44b3f7446f0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20605","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Computerized%20Interface%20Scope&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d1cd8134510d691c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This item is a small electrobinocular device, mounted onto a weapon, that projects a targeting image onto a monocle or helmet display worn by the wielder. Additionally, the computer image projected by the scope can be displayed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"}," or transmitted by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," to a remote location, allowing others to see what the wielder sees.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["By using a Computerized Interface Scope, the wielder effectively reduces the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," of the target by one category (to a minimum of Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},") when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"},". The device is otherwise mechanically identical to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," (Standard) and does not stack with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," or with any other device that does not stack with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
